  "decision": "Keep live serial count fusion. For map and where over one million items, it removes the retained intermediate list: macOS peak RSS falls from about 47 MB to 13 MB, and Linux from 68-80 MB to 15 MB, with median latency near parity. The untouched par-map control remains near parity. This identity/predicate microbenchmark does not isolate dispatch from expression evaluation and does not justify bytecode or compiled stage blocks; require a real bottleneck before adding that machinery."
}
